WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.741 --> 00:00:14.615
"I have to stop those boulders!" cried Roxy.

2
00:00:14.616 --> 00:00:17.902
The giant boulders rolled fast toward Metro City.

3
00:00:17.902 --> 00:00:21.934
Roxy fired her eye laser beams at the bottom of the mountain.

4
00:00:21.934 --> 00:00:26.733
Ka-boom! She blasted a huge hole in the ground.

5
00:00:26.733 --> 00:00:30.290
The boulders reached the bottom of the mountain.

6
00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:35.719
Then they rolled right into the hole.

7
00:00:35.719 --> 00:00:37.688
"Yes!" cheered Roxy.

8
00:00:37.688 --> 00:00:41.718
"Now where is that monster?"

9
00:00:41.718 --> 00:00:45.598
Roxy flew over the mountains.

10
00:00:45.598 --> 00:00:49.715
She finally spotted enormous footprints.

11
00:00:49.715 --> 00:00:53.702
She followed the footprints through a valley and around a tall mountain.

12
00:00:53.702 --> 00:00:57.365
Then Roxy stopped.

13
00:00:57.365 --> 00:00:59.530
She heard a deep rumbling sound.

14
00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:04.107
"That sounds like someone snoring!"

15
00:01:04.107 --> 00:01:08.323
She flew over another mountain and saw a field of wildflowers.

16
00:01:08.323 --> 00:01:14.253
The monster lay in the middle of the field, sleeping next to a mansion.

17
00:01:14.253 --> 00:01:17.004
A man stood on the balcony.

18
00:01:17.004 --> 00:01:18.785
He blinked at Roxy.

19
00:01:18.785 --> 00:01:21.460
"You're Rocket Girl, right?"

20
00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:24.761
Roxy nodded. "Who are you?"

21
00:01:24.761 --> 00:01:27.253
"Professor Newt," said the man.

22
00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:28.958
"I study reptiles.

23
00:01:28.958 --> 00:01:32.217
Why are you here?"

24
00:01:32.218 --> 00:01:34.541
Roxy was confused.

25
00:01:34.541 --> 00:01:37.545
"Do you know this monster?"

26
00:01:37.546 --> 00:01:40.390
"She's not a monster," said Professor Newt.

27
00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:42.288
"She's my pet reptile.

28
00:01:42.288 --> 00:01:44.409
Her name is Bessie."

29
00:01:44.409 --> 00:01:46.879
"Bessie?" Roxy repeated.

30
00:01:46.879 --> 00:01:49.913
Professor Newt nodded.

31
00:01:49.913 --> 00:01:54.126
"My friend gave me a mysterious reptile egg for my birthday.

32
00:01:54.126 --> 00:01:57.004
When the egg hatched, out came Bessie."

33
00:01:57.004 --> 00:02:02.372
He laughed. "I had no idea she would grow this big!"

34
00:02:02.372 --> 00:02:03.976
Roxy frowned.

35
00:02:03.976 --> 00:02:10.241
"Well, Professor Newt, Bessie almost destroyed Metro City!"

36
00:02:10.241 --> 00:02:12.684
"Oh dear!" said Professor Newt.

37
00:02:12.684 --> 00:02:16.366
"She must have smelled the flower show."

38
00:02:16.366 --> 00:02:19.830
He looked at the large reptile.

39
00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:22.422
"Bessie loves flowers.

40
00:02:22.422 --> 00:02:25.476
She usually just eats the wildflowers here.

41
00:02:25.476 --> 00:02:29.096
But I guess she wanted to try some new flowers.

42
00:02:29.096 --> 00:02:31.854
How much damage did she do?"

43
00:02:31.854 --> 00:02:35.811
Roxy told Professor Newt what Bessie had done.

44
00:02:35.811 --> 00:02:38.232
The professor gasped.

45
00:02:38.232 --> 00:02:42.839
"Oh no! I must apologize to Mayor Bloom.

46
00:02:42.839 --> 00:02:48.942
And from now on, I will keep Bessie up here in the mountains.

47
00:02:48.942 --> 00:02:56.371
Bessie is sweet, but she can cause a lot of trouble!"

48
00:02:56.371 --> 00:03:00.090
"Are you still playing Frisbee?" Roxy called.

49
00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:03.049
She walked into Mara's backyard.

50
00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:05.136
Puddles were everywhere.

51
00:03:05.136 --> 00:03:07.299
Mara and Jack were soaked.

52
00:03:07.299 --> 00:03:09.535
"Nope," said Jack.

53
00:03:09.535 --> 00:03:13.202
"There was a huge monster!" said Mara.

54
00:03:13.202 --> 00:03:17.157
"And Rocket Girl dumped water on us!"

55
00:03:17.157 --> 00:03:24.302
Roxy grinned. "Terrell said he wanted to go to the water park! Where is—"

56
00:03:24.302 --> 00:03:27.270
Terrell jumped out from behind a bush.

57
00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:29.531
He was holding a garden hose.

58
00:03:29.531 --> 00:03:33.613
"Gotcha!" he yelled, blasting Roxy with the hose.

59
00:03:33.613 --> 00:03:38.368
"Hey!" Roxy yelped in surprise.

60
00:03:38.369 --> 00:03:40.898
But then she laughed along with her friends.

61
00:03:40.898 --> 00:03:48.194
On such a hot day, the cool water felt great!
